    {
        "content": "<p>When I run <code>lake -v lean Main.lean</code> I get a lot of stack trace but I think the steps are emboldened<br>\n[2/4]</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Bash\"><pre><span></span><code>ℹ<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">2</span>/4<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Replayed<span class=\"w\"> </span>Leanhack.Basic\ntrace:<span class=\"w\"> </span>.&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">LEAN_PATH</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>/var/home/sk/leanhack/.lake/build/lib/lean<span class=\"w\"> </span>/var/home/sk/.elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4-nightly---nightly-2026-04-13/bin/lean<span class=\"w\"> </span>/var/home/sk/leanhack/Leanhack/Basic.lean<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span>/var/home/sk/leanhack/.lake/build/lib/lean/Leanhack/Basic.olean<span class=\"w\"> </span>-i<span class=\"w\"> </span>/var/home/sk/leanhack/.lake/build/lib/lean/Leanhack/Basic.ilean<span class=\"w\"> </span>-c<span class=\"w\"> </span>/var/home/sk/leanhack/.lake/build/ir/Leanhack/Basic.c<span class=\"w\"> </span>--setup<span class=\"w\"> </span>/var/home/sk/leanhack/.lake/build/ir/Leanhack/Basic.setup.json<span class=\"w\"> </span>--json\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>[3/4]</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Bash\"><pre><span></span><code>ℹ<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"m\">3</span>/4<span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>Replayed<span class=\"w\"> </span>Leanhack\ntrace:<span class=\"w\"> </span>.&gt;<span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nv\">LEAN_PATH</span><span class=\"o\">=</span>/var/home/sk/leanhack/.lake/build/lib/lean<span class=\"w\"> </span>/var/home/sk/.elan/toolchains/leanprover--lean4-nightly---nightly-2026-04-13/bin/lean<span class=\"w\"> </span>/var/home/sk/leanhack/Leanhack.lean<span class=\"w\"> </span>-o<span class=\"w\"> </span>/var/home/sk/leanhack/.lake/build/lib/lean/Leanhack.olean<span clas